.73 23.02 28.73 16C28.73 8.98 23.02 3.27 16 3.27Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </svg></div><!----></div><h2 class="e-modal__heading" data-test-id="heading" data-v-a7583600>Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready</h2><!----><div class="e-modal__slot-wrapper" data-test-id="slot-wrapper" data-v-a7583600><!--[--><div class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__content" data-v-d4c8c135><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> We need to log you out to update your pricing. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> Simply log back in and start booking parcels to see your new discounts automatically applied. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__countdown" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-v-d4c8c135> Logging you out in 10 seconds... </p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></dialog><!--]--></div></section><section id="frequently-asked-questions" class="faqs" index="7" data-v-6bee4b86><div class="faqs-content" data-v-6bee4b86><h2 class="faqs-title" data-v-6bee4b86>Frequently asked questions</h2><!--[--><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="canitrackmyparcel-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-canitrackmyparcel" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-canitrackmyparcel" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-Can I track my parcel?-open answer" data-test-id="canitrackmyparcel-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="canitrackmyparcel-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Can I track my parcel?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-canitrackmyparcel" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-canitrackmyparcel" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="canitrackmyparcel-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Tracking is included on every parcel you send with Evri for no extra cost. Once you’ve received the 16-digit tracking number for your parcel, simply <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/track-a-parcel" rel="noreferrer" target="_self"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->head to our tracking page<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> and plug it in to see where your parcel is on its journey.  <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="canipurchasecoverformyparcel-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-canipurchasecoverformyparcel" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-canipurchasecoverformyparcel" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-Can I purchase cover for my parcel?-open answer" data-test-id="canipurchasecoverformyparcel-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="canipurchasecoverformyparcel-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Can I purchase cover for my parcel?</span><!--]--><div class="