re.","long-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Flong-parcel",{"id":12,"type":13,"tags":14,"lang":15,"slug":16,"first_publication_date":17,"last_publication_date":17,"uid":16,"link_type":18,"key":19,"isBroken":20},"YhjzRRIAAC8A3CHH","subpath1",[],"en-gb","our-services","2022-02-25T15:18:32+0000","Document","30e96eb7-4389-4ff9-865f-54dec9546f28",false,{"link_type":18},[23,45,99,157,165,222,282,322],{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":26,"primary":36,"id":42,"slice_type":43,"slice_label":44},"horizontalWidget","sktwi1xtmkfgx8626",[27],{"contentRight":28},{"id":29,"type":30,"tags":31,"lang":15,"slug":32,"first_publication_date":33,"last_publication_date":34,"link_type":18,"key":35,"isBroken":20},"ZgVcQRIAACEApjZD","form-v2",[],"from-2.62","2024-03-28T12:02:58+0000","2026-07-09T07:23:30+0000","ae9c7cef-7068-4c93-ba4e-06e407691622",{"heading":37,"includeInternational":38,"desktopBackground":39,"tabletBackground":40,"mobileBackground":41},"Send a long parcel with a courier today",true,{},{},{},"hero_banner$2cf5c4b4-aed6-4d29-9568-24e93ba3133d","hero_banner",null,{"variation":46,"version":25,"items":47,"primary":49,"id":97,"slice_type":98,"slice_label":44},"default-slice",[48],{},{"CardImage":50,"CardAvatar":62,"CardTitle":63,"CardText":64,"ButtonText":44,"ButtonUrl":95,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":51,"alt":54,"copyright":44,"url":55,"id":56,"edit":57},{"width":52,"height":53},1000,665,"A parcel in waterproof blue packaging is being photographed by a courier as proof of delivery. A blue Evri van can be seen in the background.","long-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6y9h5bqstJ9-iIp_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9091.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6y9h5bqstJ9-iIp",{"x":58,"y":59,"zoom":60,"background":61},0,8,1,"transparent","none","Find out why we’re the best courier service for delivering your long parcel",[65,86],{"type":66,"text":67,"spans":68,"direction":85},"paragraph","With Evri, you can send a parcel as long as 1.2 meters long, just provided that the sum of the width, length and depth doesn’t exceed 245cm. This means that your average sized golf clubs, electric guitars, posters, prints and more are all fit for travel in our network. If packaged correctly, you could even send flat pack furniture or post a bike across the country. Just book a courier collection or take your long parcel down to your local ParcelShop, and let us take care of it. ",[69,77,79,84],{"start":70,"end":71,"type":72,"data":73},336,347,"hyperlink",{"link_type":74,"url":75,"target":76},"Web","long-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fhow-to-send-a-bike","_self",{"start":70,"end":71,"type":78},"strong",{"start":80,"end":81,"type":72,"data":82},432,453,{"link_type":74,"url":83,"target":76},"long-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ffind-a-parcelshop",{"start":80,"end":81,"type":78},"ltr",{"type":66,"text":87,"spans":88,"direction":85},"Check out our parcel size & weight guide for more information on how to measure your parcel to ensure that we can accept it.  ",[89,94],{"start":90,"end":91,"type":72,"data":92},14,40,{"link_type":74,"url":93,"target":76},"long-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fsend\u002Fparcel-size-and-weight-guide",{"start":90,"end":91,"type":78},{"link_type":96},"Any","card$b91694e8-50b7-479f-a980-408fcf1dc3ed","card",{"variation":46,"version":25,"items":100,"primary":132,"id":155,"slice_type":156,"slice_label":44},[101,106,110,114,118,122,127],{"column_1_cell":102,"column_2_cell":103,"column_3_cell":104,"column_4_cell":105},"0-1kg Small","£2.62","£3.04","£3.90",{"column_1_cell":107,"column_2_cell":103,"column_3_cell":108,"column_4_cell":109},"0-1kg Standard","£3.29","£4.12",{"column_1_cell":111,"column_2_cell":103,"column_3_cell":112,"column_4_cell":113},"1-2kg Small","£3.52","£4.60",{"column_1_cell":115,"column_2_cell":103,"column_3_cell":116,"column_4_cell":117},"1-2kg Standard","£4.79","£5.48",{"column_1_cell":119,"column_2_cell":103,"column_3_cell":120,"column_4_cell":121},"2-5kg","£6.59","£7.55",{"column_1_cell":123,"column_2_cell":124,"column_3_cell":125,"column_4_cell":126},"5-10kg","£5.87","£6.68","£7.72",{"column_1_cell":128,"column_2_cell":129,"column_3_cell":130,"column_4_cell":131},"10-15kg","£9.01","£10.28","£12.35",{"PricingTableImage":133,"PricingTableHeader":141,"PricingTableText":142,"PricingTableButtonText":146,"PricingTableButtonUrl":147,"scrollDown":20,"PricingTablePrimaryButtonText":44,"PricingTablePrimaryButtonUrl":150,"buttonGtmTrack":44,"PricingTableDescription":44,"table_header_row_blue":38,"table_rightmost_column_blue":20,"column_name_1":151,"column_name_2":152,"column_name_3":153,"column_name_4":154},{"dimensions":134,"alt":44,"copyright":44,"url":137,"id":138,"edit":139},{"width":135,"height":136},88,24,"long-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F2a1dcc38-ecf2-4a6a-b68d-b28f33e8fe47_send+%281%29.svg","ZcyF-hIAACgAGOcv",{"x":58,"y":58,"zoom":60,"background":140},"#fff","Discover one of the cheapest ways to send a long parcel",[143],{"type":66,"text":144,"spans":145,"direction":85},"We price our courier services based on weight, not length. So, as long as your parcel is under 15kg, you’re going to be getting an incredible price on fast and reliable shipping to the UK or internationally. Our prices are flexible, meaning you can save by delivering to a ParcelShop, or get additional services like Next Day for just a small premium. Check out our pricing table to see how cheap it is to send a long parcel with Evri.  ",[],"See more of our prices",{"link_type":74,"key":148,"url":149},"a874e2ce-6cc7-4b40-8f24-7ddb2abc973d","long-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Four-prices",{"link_type":96},"Weight","ParcelShop Delivery","Home or work Standard","Home or work Next Day","pricing_table_v2$451900fd-f0cf-4c44-9230-110bf7812736","pricing_table_v2",{"variation":46,"version":25,"items":158,"primary":159,"id":163,"slice_type":164,"slice_label":44},[],{"Image":160},{"tablet":161,"mobile":162},{},{},"photo_block$87fdb64f-f493-4a52-9178-c49a84956fcb","photo_block",{"variation":166,"version":25,"items":167,"primary":216,"id":220,"slice_type":221,"slice_label":44},"listComponent",[168,180,192,204],{"title":169,"content":170,"icon":174},"Use a box with straight edges if you can",[171],{"type":66,"text":172,"spans":173,"direction":85},"We will accept circular tubes, but to ensure that it remains stable on our conveyor belts, we recommend tubes with a flat surface to give you peace of mind.  ",[],{"dimensions":175,"alt":176,"copyright":44,"url":177,"id":178,"edit":179},{"width":91,"height":91},"Icon of a tape measue","long-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fdc53fcd3-c19c-448e-8ed2-440f14cdeee5_size_dimensions.svg","Yh96FRIAACoA-Zrl",{"x":58,"y":58,"zoom":60,"background":61},{"title":181,"content":182,"icon":186},"Pad the inside with box filler",[183],{"type":66,"text":184,"spans":185,"direction":85},"The longer the parcel, the more fragile it is likely to be. This is why it’s important to make sure that it is well padded and there is little room for your items to move around inside.  ",[],{"dimensions":187,"alt":188,"copyright":44,"url":189,"id":190,"edit":191},{"width":91,"height":91},"Parcel icon","long-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F15159101-ea95-4f4d-8762-549a8e631c4f_parcel3.svg","Yh96GBIAACwA-Zsn",{"x":58,"y":58,"zoom":60,"background":61},{"title":193,"content":194,"icon":198},"Place address information inside the box",[195],{"type":66,"text":196,"spans":197,"direction":85},"In the event that the exterior label is damaged or lost; by placing your recipient’s and your own address inside the parcel, we can put it back on track in no time.  ",[],{"dimensions":199,"alt":200,"copyright":44,"url":201,"id":202,"edit":203},{"width":91,"height":91},"Followed instructions icon","long-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F0b60c675-436d-4ca1-8857-2bfbff3cb847_followed_instructions.svg","YflB_BEAACIA8pcK",{"x":58,"y":58,"zoom":60,"background":61},{"title":205,"content":206,"icon":210},"Instruct your recipient to give the courier a helping hand",[207],{"type":66,"text":208,"spans":209,"direction":85},"Whether that be designating a safe place, nominating a neighbour or diverting to a ParcelShop, if your recipient won’t be in, these instructions will be invaluable in ensuring a safe and stress-free delivery for your courier. ",[],{"dimensions":211,"alt":212,"copyright":44,"url":213,"id":214,"edit":215},{"width":91,"height":91},"Icon of a courier","long-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ff67d24e2-931f-4df2-b583-2c51af7d6cf4_courier3.svg","Yh96FhIAACkA-Zr4",{"x":58,"y":58,"zoom":60,"background":61},{"theme":217,"title":218,"description":219},"standard","Tips for sending a long parcel with a courier","While we try to make absolutely sure that every parcel reaches its destination safely, there are some ways that you can help us achieve this:","list_block$1ebeb9bc-5c79-4723-9c76-480d8ecd56d3","list_block",{"variation":46,"version":25,"items":223,"primary":272,"id":280,"slice_type":281,"slice_label":44},[224,244],{"Title":225,"Description":230,"Image":234,"Label":44,"UrlText":240,"Url":241,"buttonDataGtmTrack":44,"SecondaryButtonText":44,"SecondaryButtonUrl":243,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":44,"ShowAppDownloadCta":20},[226],{"type":227,"text":228,"spans":229,"direction":85},"heading3","ParcelShop drop-off ",[],[231],{"type":66,"text":232,"spans":233,"direction":85},"We have 9,000+ ParcelShops conveniently located across the UK in local corner shops, Post Office branches, and many more familiar storefronts. Simply book online, head down with your parcel, print your label in-store if you haven’t already with our Print in ParcelShop devices and then hand to your friendly ParcelShop representative. It couldn’t be easier.  ",[],{"dimensions":235,"alt":236,"copyright":44,"url":237,"id":238,"edit":239},{"width":52,"height":53},"Customer walking towards a ParcelShop store holding a parcel. The blue Evri signage can be seen on the storefront with a free-standing sign near the entrance.","long-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJL5bqstJ9-Tf1_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2863.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C7723%2C5136&w=1000&h=665","Z6TJL5bqstJ9-Tf1",{"x":58,"y":59,"zoom":60,"background":61},"Find your local ParcelShop",{"link_type":74,"key":242,"url":83},"3466bd71-392a-48ea-b970-f80e8837db57",{"link_type":96},{"Title":245,"Description":249,"Image":253,"Label":44,"UrlText":259,"Url":260,"buttonDataGtmTrack":44,"SecondaryButtonText":44,"SecondaryButtonUrl":271,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":44,"ShowAppDownloadCta":20},[246],{"type":227,"text":247,"spans":248,"direction":85},"Courier collection ",[],[250],{"type":66,"text":251,"spans":252,"direction":85},"Need to fit a quick parcel drop off into your busy schedule? Our Couriers are around Monday to Saturday to make your life easier by picking up your parcel right from your doorstep. Simply book a Courier collection online and we’ll give you a 1-hour window to expect your courier.  ",[],{"dimensions":254,"alt":255,"copyright":44,"url":256,"id":257,"edit":258},{"width":52,"height":53},"An older woman hands a parcel to a courier for collection. The courier is signing a blue slip. Blue Evri van visible in the background.","long-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6oqXJbqstJ9-cLp_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10213.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6oqXJbqstJ9-cLp",{"x":58,"y":59,"zoom":60,"background":61},"Book a courier collection today",{"id":261,"type":262,"tags":263,"lang":15,"slug":265,"first_publication_date":266,"last_publication_date":267,"uid":268,"url":269,"link_type":18,"key":270,"isBroken":20},"YhYt5BIAACkA0Qf8","content-page",[264],"Our Services","arrange-a-courier-collection--local-parcel-pick-up--evri","2022-02-23T13:07:14+0000","2026-07-10T11:49:03+0000","courier-service","\u002Four-services\u002Fcourier-service","65e809f4-36a0-49f0-8814-b8f18e1f11fa",{"link_type":96},{"SectionTitle":273,"SectionDescription":278,"theme":279},[274],{"type":275,"text":276,"spans":277,"direction":85},"heading2","Drop off your parcel in one of two easy ways ",[],[],"neutral","article_link_module$5db5abe6-9d0b-4f50-996b-559c01616014","article_link_module",{"variation":46,"version":25,"items":283,"primary":284,"id":321,"slice_type":98,"slice_label":44},[],{"CardImage":285,"CardAvatar":62,"CardTitle":291,"CardText":292,"ButtonText":317,"ButtonUrl":318,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":286,"alt":287,"copyright":44,"url":288,"id":289,"edit":290},{"width":52,"height":53},"A side profile view shows an Evri branded lorry is driving along a straight road with an aeroplane that can be seen closely above.","long-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ2VIYZbqstJ98uap_EvriInternationalCourierServices.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C6016%2C4001&w=1000&h=665","Z2VIYZbqstJ98uap",{"x":58,"y":59,"zoom":60,"background":61},"Sending a long parcel internationally",[293,308],{"type":66,"text":294,"spans":295,"direction":85},"We deliver to 200+ countries and territories, meaning we can send your long parcel virtually anywhere in the world. Our prices are also some of the best on the market, so whether you’re sending a parcel to the USA, or looking for a courier service to Ireland, we’ll get your items there safely and affordably.  ",[296,301,302,307],{"start":297,"end":298,"type":72,"data":299},186,213,{"link_type":74,"url":300,"target":76},"long-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Fusa",{"start":297,"end":298,"type":78},{"start":303,"end":304,"type":72,"data":305},232,258,{"link_type":74,"url":306,"target":76},"long-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Fireland",{"start":303,"end":304,"type":78},{"type":66,"text":309,"spans":310,"direction":85},"It is worth noting that international parcel prices may be calculated based on volumetric weight. So, if your parcel weighs very little but is rather large, then you could be priced slightly higher than you might have expected. To avoid any surprises, check out our international prices. ",[311,316],{"start":312,"end":313,"type":72,"data":314},252,288,{"link_type":74,"url":315,"target":76},"long-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Finternational-prices",{"start":312,"end":313,"type":78},"Send an international parcel",{"link_type":74,"key":319,"url":320},"07aba70e-44ae-4372-8dc2-3d1a1bf81a90","long-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Finternational-send","card$ddcbfe9d-145a-4c9e-95e9-35ed3330d98c",{"variation":46,"version":25,"items":323,"primary":351,"id":353,"slice_type":354,"slice_label":44},[324,336],{"questionTitle":325,"questionBody":326},"Can I track my parcel?",[327],{"type":66,"text":328,"spans":329,"direction":85},"Tracking is included on every parcel you send with Evri for no extra cost. Once you’ve received the 16-digit tracking number for your parcel, simply head to our tracking page and plug it in to see where your parcel is on its journey.  ",[330,335],{"start":331,"end":332,"type":72,"data":333},149,174,{"link_type":74,"url":334,"target":76},"long-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ftrack-a-parcel",{"start":331,"end":332,"type":78},{"questionTitle":337,"questionBody":338},"Can I purchase cover for my parcel?",[339,342],{"type":66,"text":340,"spans":341,"direction":85},"Provided your parcel is eligible for compensation, you are entitled to £20 cover on your parcel contents completely free. For an additional fee you can increase your cover up to the value of £999 for absolute peace of mind.  ",[],{"type":66,"text":343,"spans":344,"direction":85},"You can find out if your items are eligible for compensation by checking out our guide on what you can and can’t 